<title>POLAND: PETROBANK NOV NET RISES TO PLN 1.4 MLN.</title>
<headline>PETROBANK NOV NET RISES TO PLN 1.4 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results November</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit					  1.40 vs    1.12</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				    2.38 vs    1.33</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		  4.78 vs    2.92</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	 7.31 vs    5.43</p>
<p>JANUARY-NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit					  7.58 vs   12.39</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   12.19 vs   13.50</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 30.74 vs   30.85</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	61.68 vs   49.87</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Petrobank SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
